1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Video ya leo ni kuhusu nini? Ni kuhusu sherehe za Japani.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:13,008
Sehemu ya 1: Urembo wa Sherehe ya Nebuta

3
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:17,391
Mwaka huu utasafiri wapi kwa likizo ya kiangazi?

4
00:00:17,414 --> 00:00:19,830
Nitakwenda Aomori.

5
00:00:19,853 --> 00:00:22,870
Nitazitazama sherehe za Nebuta.

6
00:00:22,893 --> 00:00:25,411
Sherehe za Nebuta?

7
00:00:25,434 --> 00:00:28,051
Ni sherehe ya aina gani?

8
00:00:28,074 --> 00:00:32,457
Dutu kubwa sana zinazotembea mjini.

9
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:35,930
Dutu hizo zimefanywa kwa mbao?

10
00:00:35,953 --> 00:00:39,437
Hapana, zimefanywa kwa karatasi.

11
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:43,076
Kuna taa nyingi ndani yake.

12
00:00:43,099 --> 00:00:46,549
Usiku zinaonekana nzuri sana, sivyo?

13
00:00:46,572 --> 00:00:53,022
Ndio, usiku dutu hizi zinang'aa mjini na ni tamu sana.

14
00:00:53,045 --> 00:00:55,869
Je, unaangalia dutu tu?

15
00:00:55,892 --> 00:00:59,580
Hapana, sote tunacheza pamoja.

16
00:00:59,604 --> 00:01:03,020
Je, hatua za densi ni ngumu?

17
00:01:03,043 --> 00:01:06,027
Hapana, ni rahisi.

18
00:01:06,051 --> 00:01:08,191
Tunacheza kwa kuruka.

19
00:01:08,214 --> 00:01:10,400
Inaonekana kuwa ya furaha!

20
00:01:10,423 --> 00:01:12,840
Ninapenda niondoke pia.

21
00:01:12,863 --> 00:01:16,046
Basi, twende pamoja.

22
00:01:16,069 --> 00:01:20,352
Je, Aomori iko mbali na Tokyo?

23
00:01:20,375 --> 00:01:24,625
Inachukua saa tatu kwa Shinkansen.

24
00:01:24,648 --> 00:01:27,338
Je, umewanunua tiketi tayari?

25
00:01:27,361 --> 00:01:30,217
Ndio, nilinunua jana.

26
00:01:30,241 --> 00:01:32,457
Hiyo ni nzuri.

27
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:35,808
Tafadhali piga picha nyingi za sherehe.

28
00:01:35,832 --> 00:01:38,482
Nitakinunua zawadi pia.

29
00:01:38,505 --> 00:01:39,755
Asante sana.

30
00:01:39,778 --> 00:01:42,161
Safari njema.

31
00:01:42,184 --> 00:01:49,289
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

32
00:01:49,289 --> 00:01:52,289
Sehemu ya 2: Utangulizi wa Sherehe ya Kanto

33
00:01:52,289 --> 00:01:55,106
Tazama picha hii.

34
00:01:55,129 --> 00:01:59,819
Waa, kuna taa nyingi!

35
00:01:59,842 --> 00:02:03,782
Hii ni Sherehe ya Kanto ya Akita.

36
00:02:03,805 --> 00:02:07,105
Sherehe ya Kanto?

37
00:02:07,128 --> 00:02:09,145
Ni nini?

38
00:02:09,168 --> 00:02:14,185
Huwa wanatumia mianzi mirefu na kuwasha taa nyingi.

39
00:02:14,208 --> 00:02:17,340
Kuna taa ngapi?

40
00:02:17,363 --> 00:02:20,213
Kuna arobaini na sita.

41
00:02:20,236 --> 00:02:22,653
Ni nzito sana.

42
00:02:22,676 --> 00:02:25,492
Wanafanya nini nayo?

43
00:02:25,515 --> 00:02:29,532
Mwanaume mmoja huibeba peke yake.

44
00:02:29,555 --> 00:02:31,538
Anaibeba kwa mikono?

45
00:02:31,561 --> 00:02:36,878
Anaibeba kwa mikono, kisha huweka kwenye bega na paji la uso.

46
00:02:36,901 --> 00:02:40,617
Eeh, anaiweka kwenye paji la uso?

47
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:43,090
Si hatari?

48
00:02:43,113 --> 00:02:47,381
Kwa sababu wanapata mafunzo mengi, hakuna matatizo.

49
00:02:47,405 --> 00:02:50,288
Ujuzi wa ajabu!

50
00:02:50,311 --> 00:02:54,329
Kukiwa na upepo, inakuwa ngumu sana.

51
00:02:54,352 --> 00:02:56,474
Haanguki?

52
00:02:56,497 --> 00:03:01,193
Unatumia mwili vizuri ili kudumisha usawa.

53
00:03:01,217 --> 00:03:05,000
Ukikaribisha, unaonekana kuwa ajabu zaidi.

54
00:03:05,023 --> 00:03:09,006
Ningependa kwenda Akita kuuona yenyewe.

55
00:03:09,029 --> 00:03:11,613
Inafanyika mwezi wa Agosti.

56
00:03:11,636 --> 00:03:14,019
Tutakwenda pamoja?

57
00:03:14,042 --> 00:03:16,659
Ningependa kwenda sana.

58
00:03:16,682 --> 00:03:26,597
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali uandike maoni.

59
00:03:26,597 --> 00:03:29,597
Sehemu ya 3: Mapambo ya Sherehe ya Tanabata

60
00:03:29,597 --> 00:03:36,290
Kuna sherehe yenye mapambo mwezi wa Agosti. Iko wapi?

61
00:03:36,313 --> 00:03:39,649
Ni Tamasha la Tanabata la Sendai.

62
00:03:39,672 --> 00:03:42,189
Tamasha la Tanabata?

63
00:03:42,212 --> 00:03:44,742
Mapambo yake ni ya aina gani?

64
00:03:44,765 --> 00:03:50,249
Mapambo marefu ya karatasi yanakwenda kwa urefu mtaani pote.

65
00:03:50,272 --> 00:03:53,455
Je, mapambo hayo ni makubwa?

66
00:03:53,478 --> 00:03:58,362
Ndiyo, ni makubwa na marefu sana.

67
00:03:58,385 --> 00:04:01,201
Yako mita ngapi hivi?

68
00:04:01,224 --> 00:04:04,568
Yako mita tano hivi.

69
00:04:04,592 --> 00:04:07,342
Eeh, ni marefu sana!

70
00:04:07,365 --> 00:04:10,981
Unapokuwa unatembea, hujagusi kichwani?

71
00:04:11,004 --> 00:04:13,921
Ndiyo, hujagusa.

72
00:04:13,944 --> 00:04:18,194
Unagusa mapambo na kutembea chini yake.

73
00:04:18,217 --> 00:04:20,901
Hiyo ni ya furaha sana!

74
00:04:20,924 --> 00:04:23,616
Je, rangi zake ni za aina nyingi?

75
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:29,167
Ndiyo, kuna nyekundu, buluu na nyingine nyingi, ni rangi nyingi sana.

76
00:04:29,191 --> 00:04:32,051
Je, yote yanatengenezwa kwa karatasi?

77
00:04:32,074 --> 00:04:38,564
Ndiyo, kila mwaka wanatengeneza mapambo mapya kwa uangalifu.

78
00:04:38,587 --> 00:04:40,931
Ni tamasha nzuri sana!

79
00:04:40,954 --> 00:04:44,238
Ningependa kupiga picha nyingi.

80
00:04:44,261 --> 00:04:48,289
Kuna maduka ya vyakula vingi pia.

81
00:04:48,312 --> 00:04:51,846
Unaweza kula vyakula vyenye ladha vya Sendai pia.

82
00:04:51,869 --> 00:04:56,919
Ndiyo, nyama ya ng'ombe na mochi ya zunda ni maarufu.

83
00:04:56,942 --> 00:05:02,398
Unapata uponyaji kutoka kwa mapambo na pia unaweza kula vyakula vizuri. Ni bora kabisa!

84
00:05:02,421 --> 00:05:07,405
Ee, basi, tuende kesho hii ya Agosti.

85
00:05:07,428 --> 00:05:10,428
Sehemu ya 4: Furaha ya Tamasha la Kanda

86
00:05:10,428 --> 00:05:15,081
Je, Tokyo ina tamasha mashuhuri pia?

87
00:05:15,104 --> 00:05:18,729
Ndiyo, Tamasha la Kanda ni maarufu sana.

88
00:05:18,752 --> 00:05:21,935
Tamasha la Kanda linafanyika lini?

89
00:05:21,958 --> 00:05:24,342
Linafanyika mwezi wa Mei.

90
00:05:24,365 --> 00:05:26,105
Mwezi wa Mei?

91
00:05:26,128 --> 00:05:28,548
Si msimu wa joto, sivyo?

92
00:05:28,571 --> 00:05:33,154
Ndiyo, lakini ni tamasha lenye joto sana.

93
00:05:33,177 --> 00:05:35,261
Wanafanya nini?

94
00:05:35,284 --> 00:05:38,934
Watu wengi wanabeba mikoshi.

95
00:05:38,957 --> 00:05:42,140
Kuna mikoshi mingapi hivi?

96
00:05:42,163 --> 00:05:44,659
Kuna mikoshi mia mbili hivi.

97
00:05:44,682 --> 00:05:48,799
Mji mzima unajaa watu.

98
00:05:48,822 --> 00:05:50,739
Mia mbili?

99
00:05:50,762 --> 00:05:53,510
Hiyo ni ajabu sana!

100
00:05:53,533 --> 00:05:59,069
Ndiyo, wote wanapiga kelele kwa sauti kubwa na kutembea kwa nguvu.

101
00:05:59,092 --> 00:06:02,275
Je, utatembea karibu na Akiba?

102
00:06:02,298 --> 00:06:08,548
Ndiyo, mitaa ya vifaa vya umeme inapitia mikokoteni na huwa mandhari ya kuvutia.

103
00:06:08,571 --> 00:06:13,479
Mchanganyiko wa mji wa kisasa na tamasha la kale, sawa sawa!

104
00:06:13,503 --> 00:06:15,565
Ndiyo.

105
00:06:15,588 --> 00:06:19,642
Watalii wengi wa kigeni huja kuuona.

106
00:06:19,665 --> 00:06:23,382
Ninapenda kujisikia katika hali hiyo.

107
00:06:23,405 --> 00:06:27,293
Kuna tamasha kubwa kila baada ya miaka miwili.

108
00:06:27,316 --> 00:06:29,374
Itakuwa lini tena?

109
00:06:29,397 --> 00:06:31,449
Mwaka ujao.

110
00:06:31,472 --> 00:06:33,589
Twende pamoja.

111
00:06:33,612 --> 00:06:35,960
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

112
00:06:35,983 --> 00:06:38,983
Sehemu ya 5: Tamasha la Gion na Mikokoteni ya Yamaboko

113
00:06:38,983 --> 00:06:43,567
Je, umewahi kusikia kuhusu Tamasha la Gion huko Kyoto?

114
00:06:43,590 --> 00:06:46,806
Nimesikia jina lake.

115
00:06:46,829 --> 00:06:49,485
Ni tamasha maarufu sana.

116
00:06:49,508 --> 00:06:53,625
Ndiyo, lina historia ya zaidi ya miaka elfu moja.

117
00:06:53,648 --> 00:06:56,370
Elfu moja?

118
00:06:56,393 --> 00:06:59,143
Ni tamasha la kale sana!

119
00:06:59,166 --> 00:07:04,416
Mwezi wa Julai mzima, kuna matukio mbalimbali.

120
00:07:04,439 --> 00:07:07,291
Mwezi mzima?

121
00:07:07,315 --> 00:07:09,857
Nimegundua kuwa ni muda mrefu!

122
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:15,610
Sehemu maarufu zaidi ni maandamano ya mikokoteni ya Yamaboko.

123
00:07:15,633 --> 00:07:18,151
Mikokoteni ya Yamaboko ni nini?

124
00:07:18,174 --> 00:07:21,702
Ni gari kubwa lililoundwa kwa mbao.

125
00:07:21,726 --> 00:07:24,342
Ni refu kama nyumba.

126
00:07:24,365 --> 00:07:28,627
Gari hilo linahamishwa vipi?

127
00:07:28,650 --> 00:07:34,267
Wanaume wengi huchukua kamba ndefu na kuvuta.

128
00:07:34,290 --> 00:07:37,307
Je, ni vigumu kusukuma?

129
00:07:37,330 --> 00:07:42,792
Ndiyo, hasa pale inapokata njia katika njia panda, huchukua muda mrefu.

130
00:07:42,815 --> 00:07:44,865
Kwa nini?

131
00:07:44,888 --> 00:07:49,818
Huweka mabambu chini ya magurudumu na kuweka maji.

132
00:07:49,841 --> 00:07:52,691
Kisha huivuta ili iweze kupinda.

133
00:07:52,714 --> 00:07:55,997
Hiyo ni kazi ngumu!

134
00:07:56,020 --> 00:08:01,004
Ndiyo, watu huwa na pumzi moja na kuzunguka polepole.

135
00:08:01,027 --> 00:08:03,643
Hiyo ndiyo sehemu ya kuvutia.

136
00:08:03,666 --> 00:08:06,650
Je, kuna tamasha usiku?

137
00:08:06,673 --> 00:08:13,523
Ndiyo, usiku kabla ya tamasha, taa za mishumaa huwaka na huwa nzuri sana.

138
00:08:13,546 --> 00:08:16,829
Inalingana na mitaa ya kale ya Kyoto, sivyo?

139
00:08:16,852 --> 00:08:21,678
Ndiyo, ni ya kimapenzi na ya ajabu.

140
00:08:21,701 --> 00:08:24,701
Sehemu ya 6: Uvutio wa Tamasha la Tenjin

141
00:08:24,701 --> 00:08:30,485
Umewahi kwenda Tamasha la Tenjin huko Osaka?

142
00:08:30,508 --> 00:08:32,428
Hapana, sijawahi.

143
00:08:32,451 --> 00:08:34,841
Ni tamasha la aina gani?

144
00:08:34,864 --> 00:08:40,447
Ni tamasha la majira ya joto katika jiji la maji, Osaka.

145
00:08:40,470 --> 00:08:43,487
Mto ndio ukumbi wa tamasha.

146
00:08:43,510 --> 00:08:47,560
Mto? Ni ajabu!

147
00:08:47,583 --> 00:08:54,875
Ndiyo, jioni zaidi ya mia moja ya meli hukusanyika mtoni.

148
00:08:54,898 --> 00:08:58,081
Zaidi ya mia moja?

149
00:08:58,104 --> 00:09:01,588
Wanafanya nini kwenye meli?

150
00:09:01,611 --> 00:09:06,627
Hupiga ngoma na kucheza kwa furaha pamoja.

151
00:09:06,650 --> 00:09:08,934
Inaonekana kuwa ya furaha!

152
00:09:08,958 --> 00:09:11,624
Je, unaweza kuona karibu na mto?

153
00:09:11,647 --> 00:09:16,933
Ndiyo, unaweza kuona kutoka juu ya daraja au pembeni mwa mto.

154
00:09:16,956 --> 00:09:20,240
Je, usiku huwa giza?

155
00:09:20,263 --> 00:09:21,981
Haina matata.

156
00:09:22,005 --> 00:09:27,421
Mashua zina taa nyingi na zinakuwa na mwanga mkali sana.

157
00:09:27,444 --> 00:09:32,028
Moto unaakisi kwenye maji, ni uzuri, sivyo?

158
00:09:32,050 --> 00:09:38,150
Ndiyo, na pia angani kuna manyunyu mengi ya moto.

159
00:09:38,174 --> 00:09:43,024
Unaweza kuona moto wa mashua na manyunyu ya moto pamoja, basi!

160
00:09:43,047 --> 00:09:44,763
Ndiyo.

161
00:09:44,786 --> 00:09:48,803
Mji wa Osaka unakuwa wa kuvutia sana.

162
00:09:48,826 --> 00:09:52,243
Je, watu wengi wanakuja?

163
00:09:52,266 --> 00:09:58,449
Ndiyo, kila mwaka zaidi ya watu milioni moja wanakuja.

164
00:09:58,472 --> 00:10:03,522
Watu milioni moja? Ni tamasha maarufu sana!

165
00:10:03,545 --> 00:10:09,728
Ee, kuna maduka mengi yanayouza vyakula tamu.

166
00:10:09,751 --> 00:10:14,401
Ningependa kula takoyaki wakati wa kuangalia tamasha.

167
00:10:14,424 --> 00:10:16,510
Ni nzuri kabisa!

168
00:10:16,533 --> 00:10:18,950
Tutakwenda pamoja kesho kucha.

169
00:10:18,973 --> 00:10:21,973
Sehemu ya 7: Uvutio wa Tamasha la Danjiri / Furaha ya Tamasha la Danjiri Kishiwada

170
00:10:21,973 --> 00:10:27,023
Osaka ina tamasha lingine maarufu.

171
00:10:27,046 --> 00:10:29,330
Ni tamasha gani?

172
00:10:29,353 --> 00:10:32,270
Ni Tamasha la Danjiri Kishiwada.

173
00:10:32,293 --> 00:10:34,825
Danjiri ni nini?

174
00:10:34,848 --> 00:10:38,231
Ni gari kubwa lililofanywa kwa mbao.

175
00:10:38,254 --> 00:10:40,838
Je, watu hupiga kuvuta?

176
00:10:40,861 --> 00:10:42,315
Ndiyo.

177
00:10:42,338 --> 00:10:47,755
Watu mia tano hivi hukimbia kwa nguvu zote wakishika kamba ndefu.

178
00:10:47,778 --> 00:10:49,961
Wanakimbia?

179
00:10:49,984 --> 00:10:52,034
Si hatari?

180
00:10:52,057 --> 00:10:56,357
Wanakimbia kwa kasi kubwa na hata hupinda pembe.

181
00:10:56,380 --> 00:11:01,597
Eeh, wanapinda bila kupunguza kasi? Ndiyo.

182
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:05,037
Hiyo ndiyo sehemu inayofurahisha zaidi.

183
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:08,243
Je, kuna mtu anayekaa juu ya gari?

184
00:11:08,266 --> 00:11:09,590
Ndiyo.

185
00:11:09,613 --> 00:11:13,073
Ndiyo, kuna wanaume wanaoitwa Daikugata.

186
00:11:13,096 --> 00:11:15,780
Wanafanya nini pale juu?

187
00:11:15,803 --> 00:11:19,619
Hupiga dansi na kuruka juu ya gari.

188
00:11:19,642 --> 00:11:22,774
Juu ya gari linalokimbia?

189
00:11:22,798 --> 00:11:25,814
Ni uwezo wa kusawazisha unaostahimili!

190
00:11:25,837 --> 00:11:27,363
Ndiyo.

191
00:11:27,387 --> 00:11:30,103
Kuutazama kunatia hofu.

192
00:11:30,126 --> 00:11:33,178
Ni tamasha lenye kusisimua!

193
00:11:33,201 --> 00:11:35,185
Linafanyika lini?

194
00:11:35,208 --> 00:11:38,091
Linafanyika Septemba na Oktoba.

195
00:11:38,114 --> 00:11:41,364
Ningependa kuona mbio za kishindo.

196
00:11:41,387 --> 00:11:44,204
Tukae kwenda Kishiwada.

197
00:11:44,227 --> 00:11:47,243
Tazama kutoka mahali salama, tafadhali.

198
00:11:47,266 --> 00:11:50,266
Sehemu ya 8: Utangulizi wa Awa Odori / Utangulizi wa Ngoma ya Awa

199
00:11:50,266 --> 00:11:54,350
Je, umewahi kusikia kuhusu Ngoma ya Awa huko Tokushima?

200
00:11:54,373 --> 00:11:58,356
Ndiyo, ni tamasha maarufu la ngoma.

201
00:11:58,379 --> 00:12:02,462
Ee, lina historia ya zaidi ya miaka 400.

202
00:12:02,485 --> 00:12:06,971
Linaendelea kwa miaka 400, ni ajabu!

203
00:12:06,994 --> 00:12:12,054
Mwezi wa nane, kwa siku nne, watu wote mjini hucheza ngoma.

204
00:12:12,078 --> 00:12:14,728
Wanavaa nguo za aina gani?

205
00:12:14,751 --> 00:12:21,634
Wanaume huvaa happi, na wanawake huvaa yukata na kuvaa kilemba cha nyuzi.

206
00:12:21,657 --> 00:12:27,165
Kucheza akiwa amevaa kofia ya uzi ni tamu sana.

207
00:12:27,188 --> 00:12:32,530
Ndiyo, na anaweka geta miguuni na kuinua juu sana wakati wa kucheza.

208
00:12:32,553 --> 00:12:36,213
Inatoa sauti ya 'katsukatsu' na inaonekana kuwa ya furaha.

209
00:12:36,237 --> 00:12:39,123
Muziki pia ni wa kipekee.

210
00:12:39,146 --> 00:12:42,638
Sauti za shamisen na taiko zinapiga hadi zinawasha mwili.

211
00:12:42,661 --> 00:12:47,478
Kwa kusikia tu, mwili unataka kucheza.

212
00:12:47,501 --> 00:12:55,751
Kuna wimbo maarufu unaosema, 'Mcheza ni mpumbavu, mwangalizi ni mpumbavu, kama ni mpumbavu sawa, basi cheza ili usipoteze.'

213
00:12:55,774 --> 00:12:58,090
Maana yake ni nini?

214
00:12:58,113 --> 00:13:05,453
Maana yake ni kwamba yule anayecheza na yule anayemtazama ni sawa, kwa hiyo ni heri ucheze ili usipoteze furaha.

215
00:13:05,477 --> 00:13:07,997
Wimbo unaoonekana wa kushangaza!

216
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:11,324
Naweza kucheza pamoja nao?

217
00:13:11,347 --> 00:13:13,933
Ndiyo, unaweza kabisa.

218
00:13:13,956 --> 00:13:17,173
Kuna mahali ambapo kila mtu anaweza kushiriki.

219
00:13:17,196 --> 00:13:22,344
Basi, nitaacha haya na kucheza kwa bidii.

220
00:13:22,367 --> 00:13:23,823
Sawa!

221
00:13:23,846 --> 00:13:27,502
Tutafurahi pamoja na kuwa na tabasamu.

222
00:13:27,526 --> 00:13:31,612
Mwaka huu, majira ya joto yatafanyika Tokushima, basi.

223
00:13:31,635 --> 00:13:34,635
Sehemu ya 9: Uroho wa Sikukuu ya Yosakoi / Uroho wa Sikukuu ya Yosakoi huko Kochi

224
00:13:34,635 --> 00:13:39,961
Umesikia kuhusu sikukuu ya Yosakoi huko Kochi?

225
00:13:39,984 --> 00:13:44,367
Nimejua jina lake, lakini ni sikukuu ya aina gani?

226
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:49,874
Inafanana kidogo na Awa Odori, lakini ni ya kisasa zaidi.

227
00:13:49,897 --> 00:13:52,113
Ya kisasa?

228
00:13:52,136 --> 00:13:54,682
Ni tofauti gani?

229
00:13:54,706 --> 00:13:57,756
Muziki ni wa uhuru kabisa.

230
00:13:57,779 --> 00:14:01,262
Kuna nyimbo za rock na samba pia.

231
00:14:01,285 --> 00:14:04,179
Rock katika sikukuu?

232
00:14:04,202 --> 00:14:08,222
Inaonekana kuwa ya kisasa na ya furaha sana!

233
00:14:08,245 --> 00:14:15,031
Ndiyo, kila timu ina mtindo tofauti wa mavazi na densi.

234
00:14:15,054 --> 00:14:17,704
Mavazi pia ni ya uhuru?

235
00:14:17,728 --> 00:14:23,311
Ndiyo, mavazi mengi ni ya rangi nyingi na ya kuvutia sana.

236
00:14:23,334 --> 00:14:27,618
Wanatumia vifaa gani wakati wa kucheza?

237
00:14:27,641 --> 00:14:32,759
Wanashika naruko, chombo cha muziki kilichotengenezwa kwa mbao.

238
00:14:32,782 --> 00:14:34,832
Naruko?

239
00:14:34,855 --> 00:14:37,719
Inatoa sauti gani?

240
00:14:37,743 --> 00:14:42,249
Inatoa sauti ya 'kachikachi' na inasaidia katika kupiga hatua.

241
00:14:42,272 --> 00:14:46,889
Timu moja ina watu wangapi?

242
00:14:46,912 --> 00:14:51,606
Timu kubwa zina zaidi ya watu 100 wanacheza pamoja.

243
00:14:51,629 --> 00:14:56,957
Watu 100 wanacheza hatua sawa, ina nguvu sana!

244
00:14:56,980 --> 00:15:03,430
Ndiyo, kuna majukwaa mengi katika mji na hadi usiku kuna shughuli nyingi.

245
00:15:03,453 --> 00:15:06,703
Inaonekana kuwa inavutia vijana.

246
00:15:06,726 --> 00:15:11,510
Ndiyo, watu wanakusanyika kutoka sehemu mbalimbali za nchi.

247
00:15:11,532 --> 00:15:15,076
Ningependa kuona mapigano ya densi yenye nguvu.

248
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:20,516
Inafanyika mwezi wa nane, basi funga tarehe zako.

249
00:15:20,539 --> 00:15:23,539
Sehemu ya 10: Sikukuu ya Moto ya Hakata Gion Yamakasa / Sikukuu ya Moto ya Hakata Gion Yamakasa

250
00:15:23,539 --> 00:15:28,401
Hatima, na tutakupatia sikukuu ya Fukuoka.

251
00:15:28,425 --> 00:15:31,708
Sikukuu ya Hakata Gion Yamakasa, ninaijua vizuri.

252
00:15:31,731 --> 00:15:34,823
Umejua vizuri!

253
00:15:34,846 --> 00:15:39,729
Hii ni sikukuu ya moto ya wanaume.

254
00:15:39,752 --> 00:15:42,469
Wanafanya nini?

255
00:15:42,492 --> 00:15:47,948
Wanabeba zana nzito sana zinazoitwa Yamakasa na kukimbia nazo.

256
00:15:47,971 --> 00:15:51,107
Ina uzito wa kiasi gani?

257
00:15:51,131 --> 00:15:54,039
Ina uzito wa tani moja hivi.

258
00:15:54,062 --> 00:15:56,588
Tani moja?

259
00:15:56,611 --> 00:15:59,894
Unaibeba ukikimbia?

260
00:15:59,917 --> 00:16:01,167
Ndiyo.

261
00:16:01,190 --> 00:16:06,440
Kuna timu kadhaa zinazoshiriki katika mbio za kilomita tano ambazo hupigania muda.

262
00:16:06,463 --> 00:16:09,313
Ni mbio za kasi, basi.

263
00:16:09,336 --> 00:16:12,553
Unakimbia kilomita ngapi?

264
00:16:12,576 --> 00:16:16,159
Unakimbia njia ya kilomita tano hivi.

265
00:16:16,182 --> 00:16:22,032
Kubeba mapambo yenye tani moja na kukimbia kilomita tano inaonekana kuwa ngumu sana.

266
00:16:22,055 --> 00:16:23,383
Ndiyo.

267
00:16:23,407 --> 00:16:29,553
Kwa hiyo, watu wanaozunguka wanamwagia mwanambio maji kwa wingi.

268
00:16:29,576 --> 00:16:32,826
Watu wanaoshabikia pia wanakuwa na joto, sivyo?

269
00:16:32,849 --> 00:16:39,232
Inaitwa 'maji ya nguvu', ambapo kila mtu anamwagia mwanambio maji kwa nguvu.

270
00:16:39,255 --> 00:16:41,709
Je, nguo zinaweza kuvuja maji?

271
00:16:41,732 --> 00:16:43,316
Ndiyo.

272
00:16:43,339 --> 00:16:47,671
Kila mtu huwa amevujika maji kabisa na kukimbia kwa nguvu zote.

273
00:16:47,694 --> 00:16:50,877
Sikukuu inaanza saa ngapi?

274
00:16:50,900 --> 00:16:57,317
Mbio kuu za mwisho huanza saa tisa kasoro dakika moja asubuhi.

275
00:16:57,340 --> 00:16:59,590
Saa tisa asubuhi?

276
00:16:59,613 --> 00:17:02,099
Ni mapema sana.

277
00:17:02,122 --> 00:17:03,708
Ndiyo.

278
00:17:03,731 --> 00:17:09,819
Lakini, watu wengi hujikusanya mjini na kususia kwa sauti kubwa.

279
00:17:09,843 --> 00:17:13,126
Kuanzia asubuhi kuna nguvu nyingi sana.

280
00:17:13,149 --> 00:17:16,675
Mimi pia nitaamka mapema ili niende kuona.